  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Mail to another character on the same account has no postage (#5575)",
  "contract": "An ordinary level-one sender can send an item to another character on its account with zero copper and is not charged the client-displayed 30 copper postage when funded. Different-account mail keeps its postage and affordability checks. Same-account money transfers still require and charge the amount sent. All sends use CMSG_SEND_MAIL with an owned fixture mailbox and real inventory GUIDs; receipt is checked after native relog.",
